# Pairs with OffsetContiguity. A recovering shard resumes its allocator from the
# trim floor instead of past the highest stored offset, so it hands out offsets
# that acknowledged writes already hold.
MODULE: OffsetContiguityRecoveryFromTail
TARGET: OffsetContiguity
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the allocator recovers from the tail and reissues acknowledged offsets
PERTURBS: ShardCrash

--- FIND
    /\ next' = RecoveredNext
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: recovered from the floor, not the high-water mark.
    /\ next' = tail
--- END